    /// `CRAW` raw image: dimensions and the `CMP1` coding header (byte range in the file).
    { ... }
        /// `CDI1/IAD1` image-area descriptor (byte range in the file).
    { ... }
    /// Anything else (`CTMD` timed metadata, unknown entries).
    { ... }

